OL,3,GNEWSAWoman 'devastated' after fiance
OL,4,Adies on Cyprus anniversary trip
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman whose fiance died while on
OL,7,Fholiday in Cyprus said they had planned
OL,8,Fto return to the country to marry after
OL,9,Ffalling in love with the island.
OL,11,FPaulo Brockway, 44, from Cardiff, died
OL,12,Fon 16 September, the day the couple was
OL,13,Fdue to fly home, after suddenly
OL,14,Fbecoming ill.
OL,16,FKerry Debono said: "I just can't
OL,17,Fbelieve it's all happened. I'm
OL,18,Fabsolutely devastated, heartbroken and
OL,19,Fmy heart is in a million pieces."
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
