OL,3,GNEWSAWoman 'devastated' after fiance
OL,4,Adies on Cyprus anniversary trip
OL,5,
OL,6,FDebono said the couple had holiday
OL,7,Finsurance which would pay for the
OL,8,Fhospital fees and the repatriation of
OL,9,FBrockway's body, but added she had set
OL,10,Fup a fundraiser because she faced
OL,11,Fpaying for a funeral no-one expected.
